    "body": "Just so I'm clear, your intention is to satisfy the whole proposal with this PR and https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1785, right? I ask because this PR doesn't seem to make any changes to HTML's navigation machinery, and only a few small additions to the session history infra.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nWe should probably update [the example just below this spec prose](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#the-dialog-element%3Ainvoker-command-steps) which uses \"POST\" as a shoddy substitute for \"DELETE\", which didn't exist as a valid method at the time that example was created. Could you also try and find more related examples of that same kinda thing?",
